WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Errrrrr...

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Uh-oh!

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
No! Watch it!

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Sorry, Squidward!

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Oh-ho! What a cute little dolly!

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
He can be our drop-master, Scott, and ride with us in the cab.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.000
Oh, great idea. Why don't I put him up front while you pick up the rest of the tracks?

00:21.000 --> 00:23.000
Thank you, Squidward!

00:23.000 --> 00:25.000
Mmm-hmm.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.000
I want to have fun!

00:28.000 --> 00:29.000
Huh?

00:31.000 --> 00:33.000
I want to get good grades!

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
Whether you should stop saying one of them!

00:37.000 --> 00:40.000
I want to destroy you!

00:41.000 --> 00:43.000
What the f-t-a-ha!

00:54.000 --> 00:56.000
That doll's my best!

00:56.000 --> 00:58.000
Oh!

00:58.000 --> 01:00.000
You gotta try it!

01:00.000 --> 01:02.000
Forget it, you nitwit!

01:02.000 --> 01:04.000
There's no way I'm getting in the back of that filthy wagon!

01:04.000 --> 01:06.000
Duh!

01:06.000 --> 01:08.000
Ow!

01:08.000 --> 01:10.000
Now you turn the lorry-again!

01:12.000 --> 01:14.000
Hey, look! We f-t-a-ha!

01:15.000 --> 01:17.000
Isn't this cozy?

01:17.000 --> 01:19.000
Please let this nightmare end.

01:29.000 --> 01:31.000
Get out of the way!

01:31.000 --> 01:33.000
Get out of the way!

01:33.000 --> 01:34.000
Whoa!

01:34.000 --> 01:36.000
Whoa!

01:46.000 --> 01:48.000
He did a good job!

01:48.000 --> 01:50.000
A teeny-bottom looks so clean now!

01:50.000 --> 01:54.000
Just one more house and I can finally say goodbye to this trash life!

01:54.000 --> 01:57.000
Let's get these in the truck and get out of here!

01:58.000 --> 01:59.000
Hey!

01:59.000 --> 02:01.000
Get away from my stuff!

02:01.000 --> 02:03.000
Oh, this isn't stuff, Patrick! It's cut!

